    "relation_requirement": "Every hypothesis relation_ref must reference a manifest relation; when no natural relation exists the builder supplies a RELATION_CANDIDATE:CURRENT_CONTEXT-* candidate.",
    "unknown_policy": "Required keys remain present. Objective values may be null or UNKNOWN, and the reducer propagates UNKNOWN/WAIT instead of guessing. relation_ref is the sole exception and must be a manifest candidate.",
    "alternative_hypothesis_policy": "The reducer evaluates every hypothesis. A TRADE is permitted only when every eligible hypothesis has the same complete action signature; different signatures produce WAIT/MATERIAL_HYPOTHESIS_CONFLICT."
